.page poweroff 8 switch the machine off

# SYNOPSIS
*poweroff*

# DESCRIPTION
`poweroff` flushes the filesystems, says `The shrine maiden is closing up for the night. Goodbye!` and asks the kernel to switch the machine off. Arguments are ignored. The login profile defines the alias `shutdown` for it.

# SEE ALSO
halt(8), shutdown(8), reboot(8)
